Once a node is removed, it goes up. Restoring a node must follow
the same procedure.

To "remove" a node, Lheight = Rheight = 0.

To re-evaluate the height of a given node, it must pre-know
heights of both subtrees.

Start building extnodes from the ground up. Reverse bfs.

If the node is nil, it's Lheight and Rheight must evaluate to 0.
